{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":9,"results":11,"assumptions":14,"buildsOn":17,"sameDomain":21,"citation":40,"learnMore":41},"signal-latency","Latenza del segnale","La velocità della luce è il pedaggio: Δt = 2h/c per il viaggio di andata e ritorno. L'orbita bassa risponde in millisecondi; i 36.000 km dell'orbita geostazionaria costano un quarto di secondo — è il motivo per cui la voce via orbita geostazionaria sembra con ritardo.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>t\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003Cmi>h\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi mathvariant=\"normal\">/\u003C/mi>\u003Cmi>c\u003C/mi>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = 2h / c\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">Δ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">t\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">h\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord\">/\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">c\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>",[6],{"label":7,"value":8},"Altitudine [km]","35.790 (100 – 40.000)",[10],"Ritardo di andata e ritorno (ms)",[12],{"label":10,"value":13},"238,7",[15,16],"Percorso r